---
description: Decide field-level findings for prepareRoles.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Generate role materials that provide enough information to negotiate coherently while preserving intended asymmetry. Distinguish private preferences from facts that may be disclosed, and bind each participant’s authority and conduct limits explicitly. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
